:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the [[Enemy Units|Enemy Unit]], see [[Li'l Mohawk Cat (Enemy)]]''
'''Li'l Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Lucky Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] increases health, attack power and recharge time and reduces deploy cost. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

