==Trivia==
*Li'l Cat has the lowest [[XP Function|XP]] cost in the game.
*Li'l Cat is the smallest unit in the game.
*Li'l Mohawk Cat has the second lowest deployment cost in the game, beaten only by [[Cheetah Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Cheetah Cat]].
